                            <comment id="16531299" author="ilantukh" created="Tue, 3 Jul 2018 12:33:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=DmitriyGovorukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;DmitriyGovorukhin&quot;&gt;DmitriyGovorukhin&lt;/a&gt;, thanks for contribution!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve reviewed your changes. My main concern is regarding architecture - with your changes we will have 2 mechanics to temporary disable WAL (in WalStateManager and WALDisableContext) that have similar logic, but are completely independent with each other. Please check whether it is possible to generify this logic into single unit.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
